From 1cf1e27431659c7bbaf264a90e1e29eccab4dd56 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Locus Wei-Han Chen <locus84@andestech.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Apr 2024 14:05:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] riscv: andes: Support Qilai

1. Add relevant features to OpenSBI to support the required
   functionality for Qilai.

2. The hart1 enable bit adds 1 bit, indicating that
   the sp(slave processor) sends IPI to mp(master processor).

Signed-off-by: Locus Wei-Han Chen <locus84@andestech.com>
